{{also|Recollect}}
==English==

===Etymology 1===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|ML.|recollectus||remembered, composed}}, from {{der|en|la|recolligo||gather again, recover}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{a|UK}} {{enPR|rĕ-kə-lĕktʹ}}, {{IPA|/ɹɛkəˈlɛkt/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{enPR|rĕ-kə-lĕktʹ}}, {{IPA|/ɹɛkəˈlɛkt/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-recollect.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɛkt|lang=en}}

====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# To [[recall]]; to [[collect]] one's thoughts again, especially about past events.
#: ''I remember the concert clearly, but I can't '''recollect''' why I was there.''

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|en|collect}}
* {{l|en|recollection}}

